<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-13T23:45:23.693Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 23:45:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has seized the towns of Bakori and Sali in West Kordofan while continuing offensives that recaptured Al-Khuwai and other areas in West and North Kordofan from the RSF. The RSF has intensified drone strikes, killing nine civilians in the Blue Nile and accounting for two thirds of child casualties in the conflict. An RSF drone was downed by the army in the south, reportedly launched from Ethiopia. A senior RSF commander defected to the army after 13 years of service, and Vinícius Jr of Real Madrid sent a video message to a boy who received prosthetic legs after a drone strike. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9Sb255ek9CX0dfdjdIWUNqWDNzbUFKYWVjV1BQcDhXYXRkMV9kcjlaRG9EMGx1bWtBS1M4RmJCNW00N0d3MmJNa19DTm51S3c3cmZsLUVMcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNU0Y3N3dwVkdGV1BpRmwxQ0FIYmYxVlRabkE2VU96bEVLMVhGVG01VTd6VDdpWFM0bktUSTZJczFsX2pHWWZ6SjN3RUVBbGRwaGJJUWtOUUFWcW1CUVV6bzItdjNHVm0zUmJ5VEI4RVhDLUV2RFV4Z3d5NGphSER3cXFBTHg3RDV3Smg4c0tUTVFTUHg0X2paSmRORWk?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE10SUsxd3RmTm02WHJXQWxjdF9iaVlyMDlNSGtucmFmOHZoOFdwMVRxQ2c5XzV5Z3lQY2hLTmRKT3lsdXhkdzVqSlU5bU9BR1NyclJ1MTllWVAyczItcU5OeWJzWTNnNXE0VUNkS014NkFSZHFydk8wM0lycFQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Xinhua&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTFBDVmt3M2l1emg3dV9DZzgzOWJPTktNSXBpZ0tMaVUtNW9NYVZ3a0o3QjM2SUpoeUYtc3BxdFVKMmp3UG9mNnctWkFfQWtZWS1ja3FVSF93X192M2p1V3cwSlNnR2ZXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;A News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOUlNUektlMDhSZDV0QmRneTEtWGRORTJYbGZ